    "Can you write it down?": ["The address is 1428 Elm Street.","Sorry, can you write it down?","地址是 Elm 街 1428 號。 / 歹勢，會使共寫落來無？"],
    "No worries.": ["Sorry I'm a little late!","No worries. I just got here, too.","歹勢，我較晏到一屑仔！ / 無要緊，我嘛是拄才到。"],
